# Multiuser configuration for the SFTP server.
#
# This file is read from /etc/sftp/users.conf inside the container.
#
# Format (whitespace separated):
#     <name> [uid] [gid] [home]
#
# If uid/gid are omitted, the defaults (SFTP_UID / SFTP_GID) are used.
# If home is omitted, it defaults to <SFTP_CHROOT_BASE>/<name>/data
# (e.g. /sftp/alice/data).
#
# Optional per-user files (same directory):
#     authorized_keys/<name>   -> the user's public key(s)
#     passwords/<name>         -> the user's password
#
# Example:
# alice 1001 1001 /sftp/alice/data
# bob   1002 1002
